kur (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: graphical system installer for Debian 13 (Trixie).
    - Slint UI (software renderer), sidebar wizard: locale, timezone,
      partitioning, account, install.
    - Automatic GPT layout (ESP + optional swap + ext4 root) and manual
      partition role assignment with pre-flight validation.
    - Refuses the live medium as an install target; refuses to start without
      a reachable Debian mirror.
    - Threaded install engine with weighted progress reporting; installs the
      BacakOS desktop packages when the live image stages them.

 -- Anadolu Panteri <bilgi@anadolupanteri.org.tr>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
